WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.530
<b>Army of One</b>

3
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.050
Are you all right, sir?

4
00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:38.090
How did they capture you?

5
00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.630
I was stupid.

6
00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.970
All this time,
I trusted Kyoshiro,

7
00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:44.140
but he stabbed me in the back.

8
00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:51.560
Anyway, what the
hell happened to the tree?

9
00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:52.770
Big Mom.

10
00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:53.910
She started throwing
a fit back in the dome.

11
00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:58.380
And her attack
made it all the way out here?

12
00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:00.800
Well, that's terrifying.

13
00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.050
Though she did help me escape.

14
00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:05.590
After all these years

15
00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:10.850
I can't believe Kyoshiro was
one of Oden's retainers.

16
00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:12.640
I don't give a damn about

17
00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.890
Wano's history or its future.

18
00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:19.730
Anyone who betrays me will pay.

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:27.910
Charge!

20
00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:37.160
You-gara won't take
another step!

21
00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.590
They're not
as tough as they look.

22
00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:51.050
Butcher them!

23
00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:53.100
We will not submit!

24
00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.930
Not to you-gara, or anyone else!

25
00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:58.020
Bring it on.

26
00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.930
Now, we will take
care of the rest!

27
00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.100
Not yet.

28
00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:34.010
Forget about us?

29
00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:36.180
Dog! Cat!

30
00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:39.320
I think we deserve a turn first.

31
00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.200
That's right.

32
00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.500
It's more than just
the Straw Hats down there.

33
00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:49.000
Those are definitely
prisoners from Udon.

34
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.190
My prisoners.

35
00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.400
Even Hyogoro's here!

36
00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.200
Step away for a sec
and it all goes to hell!

37
00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.410
What happened at the labor camp?

38
00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:01.500
Babanuki wouldn't
betray me, right?

39
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.370
This is the Chief Warden.

40
00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.630
It seems we finally got through.

41
00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.170
All of our enemies are
sitting quietly behind bars.

42
00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.670
That includes Straw Hat Luffy,
Captain Kid,

43
00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.380
and all the other rebels.

44
00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:16.390
I just called to let you
know that all is well.

45
00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.810
It just doesn't add up.

46
00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.810
Don't worry,
I won't blame you for this.

47
00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:26.730
I know who you are, after all.

48
00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:28.060
You're an idiot.

49
00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.820
You were doing so well
till you hit the last part!

50
00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.900
Your antics aside,

51
00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.860
we need to settle this
situation immediately.

52
00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:39.400
Whatever.
Stop bossing me around.

53
00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.890
Hey, Straw Hat! Eat shit!

54
00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:48.040
The island is in chaos
from top to bottom.

55
00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:51.420
You only joined
the Beast Pirates

56
00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:54.220
because the situation
forced you to.

57
00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.440
Now's your chance for revenge.

58
00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:59.230
You're telling me
to betray Kaido?

59
00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:01.610
Don't take me for a fool.

60
00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:08.080
What have you been
trying so hard to predict?

61
00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:11.960
The probability that a certain
man survives the night.

62
00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:15.040
Just one percent? I pity him.

63
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.880
Can you hear me? Tobi Roppo?

64
00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:26.800
I'm busy! Ugh!

65
00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.430
What do you want, King?

66
00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.810
I'm sure you're aware
of the current situation.

67
00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.650
It doesn't reflect well on us.

68
00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:37.150
We're gathered today
for the Fire Festival,

69
00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.780
but even with
all our forces here,

70
00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.780
we still allowed
the samurai to invade.

71
00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:45.280
This is without
a doubt the biggest error

72
00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.990
in Onigashima's history.

73
00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.700
We must put aside
our internal strife,

74
00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:54.080
even if Kaido was the one
who encouraged it.

75
00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.330
I don't get it.

76
00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:57.460
I'm referring to
the promise he made.

77
00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.210
Right now, I'm sure
you're searching for

78
00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.090
Young Master Yamato,

79
00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.010
hoping to earn the right
to challenge one of

80
00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:06.260
the Lead Performers
for their position.

81
00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:09.300
I was looking forward
to it, myself.

82
00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.140
But we must postpone
that for now.

83
00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.810
What? You cheater!

84
00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.520
– He had no choice.

85
00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:18.020
Look around, Sis. It's madness.

86
00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:21.690
Oh, Pay-Pay!
I was hoping you'd pop up!

87
00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:23.900
Yamato climbed over
a wall and got away,

88
00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:26.530
so I need you to carry me
on your back and...

89
00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:27.780
– No.
– How dare you!

90
00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.660
Shut up, you stupid brats.

91
00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.240
– Who are you calling a brat?
– Who are you calling a brat?

92
00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.500
Don't lump me
together with Ulti!

93
00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:37.210
Kaido is fighting
on the rooftop.

94
00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.670
Right now, the enemy is trying

95
00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.960
to reach the top
from the inside.

96
00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:45.760
Move quickly. Stop them
dead in their tracks.

97
00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.840
We have 30,000 troops.

98
00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.600
They only have 5,000.

99
00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.430
We should be able to
overwhelm the enemy.

100
00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:55.600
But that doesn't mean
you should underestimate them.

101
00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.190
Good luck.

102
00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.060
Heh.

103
00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.730
Cu-lick.

104
00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.900
Hey, Drake!

105
00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:07.240
We can take advantage
of this mess.

106
00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.030
Come with me.

107
00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:11.280
I got a plan,
but I can't do it alone.

108
00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.490
Hm? You care
to elaborate first?

109
00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:17.750
I have somebody
that I want to kill.

110
00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:18.170
We're taking out Queen.

111
00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.590
Don't get me involved in
your petty little rivalry.

112
00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:23.800
We can't afford to
diminish our forces.

113
00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:26.220
We'll be much better
off without him.

114
00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.060
I dunno about this.

115
00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.720
Don't worry, Sir Luffy!

116
00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.310
Keep aiming for the top!

117
00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.270
Our men'll clear
the way for you!

118
00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.730
Yeah! So save your strength!

119
00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:41.520
You're gonna
need it soon enough!

120
00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:49.900
Forward!

121
00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:54.280
Open up a path
for the Straw Hat Crew!

122
00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.140
We're not losing
to criminal scum!

123
00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.440
This is certainly chaotic.

124
00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:26.600
We gotta kick that
big boy out of the way!

125
00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.520
Hard to believe such
a thing even exists!

126
00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:31.860
Don't be intimidated!
Attack its feet!

127
00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.650
We'll bring it to the ground!

128
00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:47.830
All right, fleabags,
you've had enough fun!

129
00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:43.830
All right, fleabags,
you've had enough fun.

130
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:53.810
Kaido!

131
00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.640
Jack is one of
our Lead Performers.

132
00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.980
I handpicked him myself.

133
00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.230
You really think
I'm gonna sit back

134
00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:06.110
and watch one of my most
valued men get butchered?

135
00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:08.860
I failed you, Commander.

136
00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.750
I have no excuse.

137
00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.090
Take heart, Jack.

138
00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:14.720
You didn't lose
because you're weak.

139
00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.760
They're just strong.

140
00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.680
Overwhelmingly so.

141
00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:31.530
Their Sulong power has
caused our crew grievous losses.

142
00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.570
But look at them now.

143
00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:37.490
Look at how many Minks
you've destroyed.

144
00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:42.540
Get yourself patched up.
You've done enough.

145
00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:46.690
you know?

146
00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:50.400
You know what you did,
so why don't you tell the class?

147
00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:58.620
For one, back in the capital,
you let Trafalgar Law escape.

148
00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.730
A guard overheard you.

149
00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:04.440
I'm not surprised it was you,
but I can't determine your goal.

150
00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.520
It seems so pointless.

151
00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.060
I get it now.

152
00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.110
So when you said you
wanted to kill somebody...

153
00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:12.690
It was obviously you!

154
00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:15.920
A shame that one of
our head officers was a rat.

155
00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.190
Surely you
can't be working alone.

156
00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.010
You must be feeding
intel to someone.

157
00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.260
What's your mission?

158
00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:24.190
Who are you, really?

159
00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:31.200
It's over. I can't
talk my way out of this.

160
00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:34.050
Kill me if you want to.

161
00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:37.180
But I will never tell
you bastards the truth!

162
00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.740
I won't kill you.

163
00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:43.280
Why would I do that, when I
could torture you instead?

164
00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:51.540
Oh, the fun
we'll have together, Drake!

165
00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:55.050
He's not so big.

166
00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:57.790
What are you doing?

167
00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.050
He's as big and mean as Oars.

168
00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.840
That fight wasn't easy!

169
00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:06.970
In fact, it took all our power
combined to knock him out.

170
00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.770
Not this time!

171
00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:16.280
Now, Gum-Gum...

172
00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:21.980
Luffy!

173
00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.790
– ...Calibur!
– ...Gun!

174
00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.330
Oh! That power!

175
00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:35.500
He looks just like
the God of Fire himself!

176
00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.750
just like the
God of Fire himself!

177
00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:44.600
Huh?!

178
00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:57.770
All right, fine.

179
00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:01.480
Aww! Here I was hoping
you'd put up a fight.

180
00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.690
It's more fun that way.

181
00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:06.230
Here you go.

182
00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:06.760
Consider this a parting gift.

183
00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:08.220
Bye-bye.

184
00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:14.140
Oh, shit.

185
00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.110
Fine. But now what?

186
00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.240
Can't go back to the Navy!

187
00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:28.620
No! Figure that out later!

188
00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:34.210
I can't give up.
There's still hope.

189
00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:46.180
Get out of my way! Juki!

190
00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:49.600
X...

191
00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.060
...Kong...

192
00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:54.610
– ...Calibur!
– ...Gun!

193
00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:11.180
Come on! Seriously?

194
00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.520
What?

195
00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.800
Nicely done!

196
00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:28.970
Hold on.

197
00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.020
It's Drake, from the Tobi Roppo!

198
00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.650
Why's that guy
helping out Luffy?

199
00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:42.110
Don't give up! Not yet!

200
00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.160
Cut it out!

201
00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.120
Damn it!

202
00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:53.370
I'm telling you,
Luffy's the best!

203
00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.500
Straw Hat Luffy!

204
00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:59.220
I can't explain now,
but I am an army of one!

205
00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.470
Let me help!

206
00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:01.930
Let me fight beside you!

207
00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:06.300
I'm not your enemy!

208
00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:14.770
Huh?

209
00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.270
Seems

210
00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.440
Seems kind of suspect.

211
00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:26.820
Why the sudden
change of heart, huh?

212
00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.650
Not to mention
this guy's a perv.

213
00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:32.320
This creep spied on Nami
and Robin taking a bath

214
00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.990
back in the Flower Capital!

215
00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:35.620
Wait. What happened?

216
00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.620
Looks like he
became half-dinosaur.

217
00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:41.790
Seems to be a signature power
among the Tobi Roppo.

218
00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:45.420
But something isn't right.

219
00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.590
Has he lost his frickin' mind?

220
00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:49.500
Hey, Drake! What gives?

221
00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.550
Why did you attack
one of the Numbers?

222
00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:55.390
I'm telling you,
Luffy's the best!

223
00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.100
I don't know
exactly how to put it.

224
00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:59.850
It's like, if he's your friend,

225
00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:01.940
he feels closer than
anything in the world.

226
00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.400
But if he's your enemy,
he's totally out of reach!

227
00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.900
He's more than a pirate.

228
00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.940
There's no one else like him!

229
00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:11.280
Hm? What does that even mean?

230
00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.700
There's just
something about him!

231
00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.990
He has this power
that draws everyone in!

232
00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:20.240
I think I know you!

233
00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:22.360
Why do you wanna
take down Kaido?

234
00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.330
I can't tell you why,

235
00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.830
but I assure you
our goals align.

236
00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.410
Whatever you want from us,

237
00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.200
we're too late in the game
to deal with this crap!

238
00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:39.660
Luffy!

239
00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.080
You know what he's done, right?

240
00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:41.820
This guy is Kaido's lackey,
just like Hawkins!

241
00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:44.860
Huh? Just like that?

242
00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:49.420
Listen! I left that position,
and they want me dead!

243
00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.340
Oh, so now you want
our protection?

244
00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.550
I don't want backstabbers

245
00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.640
anywhere near my captain!

246
00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:59.480
Luffy doesn't need
your help, so stay away.

247
00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:04.060
Even among fellow pirates,
there's still a code of honor!

248
00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:10.470
Franky? Jinbe?

249
00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:28.850
Okay, Drake. You can help.

250
00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.350
– Luffy, no!
– Luffy, no!

251
00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:33.690
I know you're the captain,
but stay the hell outta this!

252
00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.600
Can't really blame you!

253
00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:38.600
You must get to the roof,
Luffy! Now hurry!

254
00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:41.730
You must get to the roof,
Luffy! Now, hurry!

255
00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:44.560
Thanks, guys. I'm on it!

256
00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:50.260
Hey, Sanji. Let's make it
to the big battle!

257
00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.050
Yeah!

258
00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.880
I think I
figured out who's in charge

259
00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.720
of all the samurai and pirates.

260
00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:56.880
It's that straw hat guy
from before!

261
00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.520
Let's go after him.

262
00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.770
Let's help Straw Hat!

263
00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.690
Do whatever you can
to hold them back!

264
00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:06.030
Get out of our way,
if you know what's good for you!

265
00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.530
I'm gonna smash you

266
00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:27.530
I know those two jerks.
I fought them earlier!

267
00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.240
Wait a sec.

268
00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.870
That's the dinosaur guy
from the capital.

269
00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:42.880
Hold on. Who's that
ultra-cutie there with him?

270
00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:49.130
I'll see to it you
don't get anywhere near Kaido!

271
00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.440
This ends now, Straw Hat!

272
00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.860
Special Attack! Green Star, go!

273
00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:02.820
Wait for it. Skull-Bomb Grass!

274
00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:10.460
Pay-Pay!

275
00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:17.630
Wh-Who's there? Answer me!

276
00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.720
It's me! Nami!

277
00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:24.550
What the hell
is wrong with you?

278
00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:27.720
There's nothing I love
more than stomping lizards!

279
00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.140
Okay. I hope you're ready!

280
00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:33.390
Huh? Cut that out, you idiot!

281
00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:37.270
Did you call me a lizard?

282
00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:38.440
Stay where you are!

283
00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:41.110
Unless you wanna be
doused in repticide!

284
00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:43.650
Don't hide behind me!

285
00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.360
How dare you shoot me!

286
00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:49.740
Which one of you
did it? Fess up!

287
00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.030
Over here, Pay-Pay!

288
00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:53.660
It was that
scrawny little tramp!

289
00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.040
She's right!
You've met your match!

290
00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:58.380
For I'm the Great
Lizard Buster Nami!

291
00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.130
Better rember my name!

292
00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:02.130
I told you! Enough!

293
00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:06.550
That wasn't me
talking, but it doesn't matter!

294
00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:10.010
We're already knee deep
in this fight!

295
00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:12.850
Fine! I'm not scared!

296
00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.520
Show me the worst you can do!

297
00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:16.840
Huh?!

298
00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:22.440
Y'know, your words don't
match your actions at all!

299
00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:23.980
Like you're one to talk!

300
00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:26.320
I won't let you get away!

301
00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.240
You're in it deep
for hurting Pay-Pay!

302
00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.320
We're outta here!

303
00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:30.360
G-Good Bye!

304
00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:33.160
– You'll never take us alive!
– You'll never take us alive!

305
00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.540
– Stop running!
– Stop running!

306
00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:40.540
– Wait!
– Wait!

307
00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:44.380
Way to go, Usopp!
You better protect Nami!

308
00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:47.340
Right, let's go.
Kinemon's waiting for us!

309
00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.370
Yeah!

310
00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:59.390
You gotta
cover your ears, Sanji!

311
00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:00.900
Yeah. All right!

312
00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:04.770
I'm about to drop
some Fighting Music! Slash!

313
00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:06.970
<b>SLASH</b>

314
00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:15.260
Learned from last time,
huh? Aren't you clever!

315
00:22:16.220 --> 00:22:20.760
But you know, you're about
to be in for a bad time!

316
00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:23.890
You kinda need that sense
of hearing to fight, boy!

317
00:22:23.890 --> 00:22:26.180
Check it out!

318
00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:29.700
<b>Scratchmen Apoo
(Captain of the On Air Pirates)
Informant to the Beast Pirates
Bounty: 350 Million Berries</b>

319
00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:10.130
Goki!

320
00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:12.220
Juki!

321
00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:14.640
It's bumming me out

322
00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:17.260
to see you guys
like this right now!

323
00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:21.060
C'mon. What the hell
happened here, man?

324
00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:22.640
There was a time
when the ten of you

325
00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:27.230
wrecked cities like
it weren't no thing!

326
00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.940
This pisses me off.

327
00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:33.900
Those weak-sauce
buzz-kills think

328
00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:35.280
they can roll up to our party

329
00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:36.870
and clobber the piss
out of you guys,

330
00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:38.240
just 'cause you're wasted?

331
00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:40.750
That's the ultimate diss!

332
00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:47.000
Haccha, haccha.

333
00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:53.840
All right. It's time to party.

334
00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:55.800
Haccha!

335
00:23:55.800 --> 00:23:58.720
Haccha.

336
00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:03.730
Have you sobered up yet?

337
00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:08.730
There's ten of these guys?

338
00:24:08.730 --> 00:24:11.110
I gotta score some more cola!

339
00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:13.900
With a name like the "Numbers,"
I should've known.

340
00:24:13.900 --> 00:24:15.700
Now, Ancient Giant,
it's time to go.

341
00:24:15.700 --> 00:24:18.200
Show 'em what happens
when you get in the flow!

342
00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:20.240
Fe, to the Fi,
to the Fo, to the Fum.

343
00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:22.700
Give it up, give it up!
Let's get dumb!

344
00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:27.750
What the hell? Is he able
to command those guys?

345
00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:29.170
He's so annoying!

346
00:24:29.170 --> 00:24:31.380
Just ditch them!
There's no time for this!

347
00:24:31.380 --> 00:24:34.130
You have a point. Let's go!

348
00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:36.830
Yeah!

349
00:24:39.680 --> 00:24:43.020
You can't jack my freestyle.
You're in denial! Ya-yow!

350
00:24:43.020 --> 00:24:44.890
Haccha gonna make you
run eight miles.

351
00:24:44.890 --> 00:24:47.520
Give it up, Luffy!

352
00:24:47.520 --> 00:24:49.150
Let's keep ignoring this idiot!

353
00:24:49.150 --> 00:24:50.690
Yeah! Sounds like a plan!

354
00:25:17.680 --> 00:25:19.430
Look at how strong he is!

355
00:25:19.430 --> 00:25:22.140
Careful! If he swings him
around, we're surely done for!

356
00:25:23.310 --> 00:25:24.560
Well, this is just great.

357
00:25:29.190 --> 00:25:32.230
Huh?

358
00:25:35.350 --> 00:25:36.360
Listen here.
Run straight out of the dome

359
00:25:36.360 --> 00:25:38.570
as fast as your legs
will take you!

360
00:25:39.820 --> 00:25:41.950
If we allow that
giant to run wild,

361
00:25:41.950 --> 00:25:45.160
then the samurai won't make it
to the final skirmish!

362
00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:46.620
I'm on it!

363
00:25:46.620 --> 00:25:47.750
Do your best!

364
00:25:49.030 --> 00:25:51.650
Always do!

365
00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:56.720
General Franky is not
your personal plaything,

366
00:25:56.720 --> 00:25:58.300
you big goon!

367
00:26:01.010 --> 00:26:04.350
And good luck
trying to catch me!

368
00:26:07.630 --> 00:26:09.730
Damn! No respect, I tell you!

369
00:26:09.730 --> 00:26:14.480
I'll show him I'm
not some dumb toy!

370
00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:17.860
At least hear me out!

371
00:26:17.860 --> 00:26:20.160
I have a lot to gain
from your victory!

372
00:26:20.160 --> 00:26:23.490
My life depends on it!

373
00:26:23.490 --> 00:26:25.700
How can I convince you?

374
00:26:31.790 --> 00:26:37.010
I gotta admit, you seem
like an honest guy. But...

375
00:26:40.260 --> 00:26:40.960
There won't be an alliance
till I figure out

376
00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:42.180
What?

377
00:26:42.180 --> 00:26:43.680
what makes you tick!

378
00:26:43.680 --> 00:26:47.640
Who are you, what do you want,
and who do you work for?

379
00:26:53.430 --> 00:26:55.770
Rise up! Bring the party
to the scene!

380
00:26:55.770 --> 00:26:58.480
Crank it! Numbers gonna
make you scream!

381
00:26:58.520 --> 00:26:59.900
Come on out.

382
00:26:59.900 --> 00:27:03.150
Yoo-hoo? I need your help!

383
00:27:03.150 --> 00:27:04.650
You sobered up yet?

384
00:27:08.220 --> 00:27:11.140
You better knock that shit off!

385
00:27:14.240 --> 00:27:18.120
I heard some interesting
rumors 'bout you, homie.

386
00:27:18.980 --> 00:27:20.610
Let me guess,
you're out of options,

387
00:27:20.610 --> 00:27:23.700
so you're leeching off
that weak little pirate crew!

388
00:27:25.640 --> 00:27:26.730
I never liked you, Apoo.

389
00:27:26.730 --> 00:27:30.360
I've been waiting for an
excuse to kick your ass!

390
00:27:30.360 --> 00:27:33.460
This isn't a favor for
Straw Hat. I just hate that guy.

391
00:27:33.460 --> 00:27:36.630
We've got one thing
in common, at least.

392
00:27:36.630 --> 00:27:40.300
I've got a score to settle
with this clown, myself.

393
00:27:42.320 --> 00:27:46.030
Fine, I give in!
It's an alliance!

394
00:27:46.030 --> 00:27:47.830
What did you say?

395
00:28:07.900 --> 00:28:12.450
Oh, Drakey!

396
00:28:13.700 --> 00:28:17.070
Now I got you
right where I want you,

397
00:28:17.070 --> 00:28:19.410
you traitorous turd!

398
00:28:19.410 --> 00:28:21.870
But you're more than a traitor.

399
00:28:21.870 --> 00:28:23.790
You're a spy.

400
00:28:23.790 --> 00:28:26.160
Hmph. You're pretty popular.

401
00:28:26.160 --> 00:28:28.170
Sure you want to
team up with Luffy?

402
00:28:28.170 --> 00:28:30.170
Ha. I never wanted
them as friends,

403
00:28:30.170 --> 00:28:32.170
so I'm happy to
have them as enemies.

404
00:28:32.170 --> 00:28:33.920
It's all over.

405
00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:35.920
Hey! You gotta stay with me!

406
00:28:35.920 --> 00:28:36.970
I'm trying!

407
00:28:36.970 --> 00:28:39.140
It's too much! Just leave me!

408
00:28:39.140 --> 00:28:41.850
You'll be fine! It's not bad.

409
00:28:41.850 --> 00:28:46.020
You're wrong.
It burns!

410
00:29:34.910 --> 00:29:36.250
Let's see how long you can

411
00:29:36.250 --> 00:29:39.330
survive my attacks, shall we?

412
00:29:41.670 --> 00:29:42.250
One shot and you're dead,
so I'd start running!

413
00:29:42.250 --> 00:29:46.760
One shot and you're
dead, so I'd start running!

414
00:29:51.430 --> 00:29:54.220
The thought of escape
never occurred to me!

415
00:29:54.220 --> 00:29:56.440
Blast Breath!

416
00:29:58.400 --> 00:30:00.980
Foxfire Style!

417
00:30:04.230 --> 00:30:06.860
Flame-Rend!

418
00:30:34.680 --> 00:30:37.020
You thought we'd run?

419
00:30:37.020 --> 00:30:39.480
What do you take us for?

420
00:30:39.480 --> 00:30:42.110
No more! We're done fleeing!

421
00:30:42.110 --> 00:30:44.570
The time to fight is now!

422
00:30:44.570 --> 00:30:47.400
We stand here as
Lord Oden's samurai,

423
00:30:47.400 --> 00:30:50.450
and we shall
proudly die as such!

424
00:30:51.660 --> 00:30:55.160
After relieving you
of your head, that is!
